{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cooking_campfire","model_identifier":"cooking_campfire","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# cooking_campfire\n\nCooking campfire (kitchen tier 1): a ring of stones, a fire, and a spit on forked posts with a turning roast.\n\n- Footprint: 4 x 4 columns (64 x 64 units, 1.80 x 1.80 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -34..34, y 0..36, z -24..23 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 24, construction_0 4, construction_33 4, construction_66 4, ruined 2 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 30 x 48 centred at the origin (walk-through, units stand around it)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `cooking_campfire_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `cooking_campfire_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_cooking_campfire` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `spit` turns the roast once every 3 s. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 12, 0)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, 22)\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"campfire_stone0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.5,0.0,-2.5],"to":[-11.5,3.5,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[47.5,82.5,52.5,86.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[47.5,82.5,52.5,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[48.5,70.5,53.5,75.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[48.5,70.5,53.5,75.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"dc2054a9-4875-5b91-a740-58a87920ca58"},{"name":"campfire_stone1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[11.5,0.0,-2.5],"to":[16.5,3.5,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.5,86.5,5.5,90.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.5,86.5,5.5,90.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[54.5,70.5,59.5,75.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[54.5,70.5,59.5,75.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"febc9a0c-add7-50cc-b2b1-6256a091031f"},{"name":"campfire_stone2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.5,0.0,-16.5],"to":[2.5,3.5,-11.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[47.5,82.5,52.5,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[53.5,82.5,58.5,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[47.5,82.5,52.5,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.5,76.5,5.5,81.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.5,76.5,5.5,81.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"afc798d4-b6