rpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":90.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"41da22bc-60e3-504f-814c-57d8f7ec1449","time":0.75,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":180.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"279c3853-d306-5175-aae1-3e8e7a2aa8fc","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":270.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"af7090b8-312d-56a2-a0b7-3a67abf7a705","time":2.25,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":360.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"36acbccd-86f3-5236-ba6c-be22889bb4c5","time":3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# cooking_campfire\n\nCooking campfire (kitchen tier 1): a ring of stones, a fire, and a spit on forked posts with a turning roast.\n\n- Footprint: 4 x 4 columns (64 x 64 units, 1.80 x 1.80 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -34..34, y 0..36, z -24..23 units.\n- Texture: 64 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 24, construction_0 4, construction_33 4, construction_66 4, ruined 2 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 48 x 30 x 48 centred at the origin (walk-through, units stand around it)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `cooking_campfire_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `cooking_campfire_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_cooking_campfire` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `spit` turns the roast once every 3 s. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 12, 0)\n- `slot_work` at (0, 0, 22)\n"}